# Applies only to docker/api/Dockerfile (a Dockerfile-specific ignore file
# takes precedence over any context-root .dockerignore). The build context is
# the whole repo root, but the image needs only the Python package, so
# everything else is excluded rather than listed one directory at a time.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**

# Exclude the project virtual environment from image builds
.venv
**/__pycache__
